            "notes": "Depending on how the first round went and how much cash you have, I would recommend the following\n\nDying a lot:\nBuild into health and cool down reduction. Stay alive to farm more cash.\n\nLow on cash:\nWeapon power/cool-down reduction. Farm more by healing more and by doing more damage!!\n\n** Tons of cash**:\nYou can start building into the second phase of this build, which is the swift step heal. However, you need to have enough cash to have the ability power in addition to the swift step heal. BE SMART. If you buy these items too early, you may struggle with cash, and then you won't be able to scale properly for the rest of the game.",
