            "notes": "Depending on how the game is going, you can choose a different power. In this build, my teammates would be struggling to finish the enemy/survive. So I have chosen this power. However, double cleanse is also good for this, but if you want to play more aggressive, fleet foot can be useful; however, watch your cool downs!!\n\nSame thing as before, but now you have survivability,y which means you can now be even more aggressive than before or keep your team up for longer.\n\nThe focus is still cool-down reduction, so you can bounce around and annoy the enemy team by being unkillable while also enabling your teammates to finish the enemy. Farm some cash while you're at it too!",
